[5']} 8. c3 {[6']} Nc6 {[10']} 9. Nbd2 (9. Qc2 Ne7) (9. h5 g5) 9... Ne7 10. Qc2
{[19']} h5 {[17']} 11. O-O-O Be6 12. Nh2 c6 13. f3 {[23']} Qc7 {[22']} 14. f4 {
[39'] Not a happy move for White as the KS is now blocked.} (14. Nhf1 $142)
14... Kf7 15. Nhf3 b5 16. Nb3 {[38']} Qb6 {[27']} 17. Kb1 {[45'] He decides to
wait for the attack. I thought that he might move the King back to the KS.} a5
18. Rc1 {[51']} Rhc8 {[35']} 19. Qe2 a4 20. Na1 ({If} 20. Nbd2 {then Black
does well with} c5 ({or} 20... b4)) 20... c5 {[51'] I decided that I had to
try for something now.} 21. dxc5 Bxc5 22. Nd4 {[64']} Rab8 {[59']} 23. g3 {
[1hr 13']} (23. Nxb5 Bxe3 24. Rcd1 Bxf4 25. Z0 Be5 {is good for Black.}) 23...
Bd7 {[61']} 24. Rc2 Re8 {[1hr 11']} 25. Qf3 {[1hr 20']} Kg7 {[1hr 16']} 26. Rd2
