Nc6 31. Bc2 $4 ({I was now trying to decide whether, after} 31. Qxd4 {the best
would be} Nxd4 {or 31......Re1+ when, probably getting worried about the clock
he played a hurried 31.Bc2??}) 31... Qxb2# {A bit better than Round 1, when,
not having played for about 6 months, I lost badly to Philip J Hughes (154).
The Congress was played at Morecambe High School.} 0-1

