{Time limit 40 moves in 2hrs} 1. e4 Nf6 2. Nc3 d5 3. e5 d4 {[1']} 4. Nce2 Ng4 {
[8']} 5. f4 h5 {[18']} 6. Nf3 Nc6 {[21']} 7. c3 {[10']} dxc3 {[25']} 8. bxc3 e6
9. d4 b6 10. Ng3 Bb7 11. Bd3 {[23']} Be7 {[36']} 12. O-O h4 {[41']} 13. Ne4 Nh6
14. Nf2 {[28']} g6 {[46']} 15. Qa4 {Starting a doubtful plan.} Qd7 16. Bb5 $2 {
I hardly gave this any thought, assuming that 16......a6 would weaken his QS.}
a6 {I realised the problem} 17. Bd3 (17. Bxc6 {is no better than the game.})
17... Nxe5 18. Qxd7+ Nxd7 19. Ne5 Nxe5 20. fxe5 Nf5 21. Rb1 {[42']} O-O-O {
[57']} 22. Ne4 Rh5 {[1 hr 15']} 23. Bc2 {[52']} Bd5 24. Bd3 {[63']} a5 25. a3
Kb8 {[1hr 26']} 26. Nf6 Bxf6 27. exf6 Nd6 28. Bf4 Bc4 29. Rxb6+ $6 ({I
considered} 29. Bxg6 {but} Rd5 $1 {kills it}) ({No doubt} 29. Bxc4 {is best,
but I got carried away with the text.}) 29... cxb6 30. Bxc4 e5 $1 {Wins a
piece leaving me a rook down. I was going to resign, but, for no particular
reason played...} ({I hoped for something like} 30... Kb7 31. Bxe6 fxe6 32.
Bxd6 Rxd6 33. f7 {However, I overlooked the text move.}) 31. Bxf7 Nxf7 ({
I would have answered} 31... exf4 {with resigns.} 32. Bxg6 Rh6) 32. dxe5 {
What am I doing playing on a Rook down?} g5 $1 33. Be3 {Never say die.} Nxe5
34. Bxb6 Rf8 $4 {My hoped are answered! Short of time he plays a losing move.}
35. Bc5 {Black is lost and short of time.} Nd7 {Less then 60'' for 5 moves now.
I had ~20'} ({Fritz gives} 35... Rd8 36. f7 Nd7 37. f8=Q Nxf8 38. Bxf8 g4 39.
c4 Rd2 40. c5 Ra2 41. Bd6+ Kb7 42. Rf2 Ra1+ 43. Rf1 Rxf1+ 44. Kxf1 Rh8 {-1.17/0
}) 36. Bxf8 Nxf8 37. Re1 Rh8 ({Fritz} 37... Kc7 38. Re8 Nd7 39. f7 g4 40. f8=Q
Nxf8 41. Rxf8 {0.17/0}) 38. f7 Kc7 39. Re8 Kd7 40. Kf2 g4 41. Ke3 {He now
thought for about 25' before sealing his move. He is completely lost.} h3 42.
g3 a4 43. Ke4 {Now he is completely stuck. I'm going to play 44.Kf5 then take
the Pawn then onto g7} Rh7 44. Rxf8 Ke7 45. Ra8 {Amazing! I was a Rook down
with minimal tactical chances.} 1-0

