Bg7 8. f4 {[16']} Nge7 {[23']} 9. Nf3 d6 10. g4 {[25']} Qd7 11. g5 {[28'] I
was pleased about this. It relieves some of the KS tension.} O-O-O {[34']} 12.
h4 Kb8 13. Bh3 {[40']} Qe8 {[36']} 14. Kb1 {[48']} Rf8 {[40'] I can play 14....
..d5 now, but it is even better after his next move} 15. Rh2 {[59'] Leads to a
pin on his Bishop.} d5 {[45'] Secures equality, even some initiative.} 16. exd5
{[65']} Nxd5 17. Nxd5 ({If} 17. Qxe8 Rfxe8 {I control the centre and threatn
18.......NxN+}) 17... Rxd5 18. Qg1 {[1hr 13']} Nd4 {[53']} 19. Nxd4 Bxd4 20.
Qg3 {[1hr 17']} Qb5 {[59']} 21. Bc1 {[1hr 24']} Rfd8 22. Rhd2 {Else 22......BxP
} R5d6 23. Qa3 a5 (23... Z0 {White threatened.} 24. Rxd4 Rxd4 25. Rxd4 Rxd4 26.
Qf8+) 24. c3 $4 {[1hr 32'] Loses outright. he looked aghast the moment he let
the pawn go.} Bc5 {[1hr 32']} 25. Rxd6 ({If} 25. Bf1 Be4+ 26. Ka1 Rxd2 $1 27.
Bxb5 (27. Bxd2) (27. Rxd2 Qxf1 28. Rxd8+ Kb7) 27... Rxd1 {etc.}) 25... Rxd6 26.
Bf1 ({If} 26. Rxd6 Bxd6 27. Qb3 Qd3+) 26... Be4+ 27. Ka1 Rxd1 {Rapid collapse
at the end.} 0-1

